'' A TYPED VARIADIC THROUGH A MODULE INTERFACE. The interface is source text, so the '...'
'' after an array parameter is written into it and re-parsed by the importer; a call in
'' the importing module packs its arguments as a call inside the module would -- a free
'' function, one over a UDT element with converting constructors, and a constructor.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/tvariadic/libs tests/modules/src/tvariadic/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/tvariadic.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/modules/tvariadic.exe
'' RUN: tests/modules/tvariadic.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: hi|3:Quinn|1:42
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  6 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  9
